    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147620/extras/f611187cff589ad554968023fe150218.poster.avif?t=1736895520\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147620/extras/f611187cff589ad554968023fe150218.webm?t=1736895520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147620/extras/f611187cff589ad554968023fe150218.mp4?t=1736895520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Join a terrifying journey through Scarlet Manor, a sinister place where mystery and horror intertwine. Take on the role of L\u00facio Sacramento - a brave man, hired to work as the caretaker of this strangely quiet and deeply disturbing mansion. He'll uncover dark secrets, solve challenging puzzles, and face the darkness that hides in the shadows. <br><br><strong>PUZZLES</strong><br>Your journey will be filled with challenging puzzles. Find out the unique solution for each puzzle and make your way throught the hallways of the Manor.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147620/extras/c8c049a38213f8660a34e5cacf4e88c5.poster.avif?t=1736895520\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147620/extras/c8c049a38213f8660a34e5cacf4e88c5.webm?t=1736895520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147620/extras/c8c049a38213f8660a34e5cacf4e88c5.mp4?t=1736895520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>EXPLORATION</strong><br>Each room hides crucial clues and items that will help you on your journey. Explore the mansion and take decisions that could seal your fate. How many secrets does the Manor holds? How many can you uncover?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147620/extras/50ef6c078d8cb77325b0a64eb241c9f4.poster.avif?t=1736895520\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147620/extras/50ef6c078d8cb77325b0a64eb241c9f4.webm?t=1736895520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147620/extras/50ef6c078d8cb77325b0a64eb241c9f4.mp4?t=1736895520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>This 2D point and click game, inspired by titles like Cube Escape, will push your mind and nerves to the limit. Explore an intriguing narrative, atmospheric graphics and complex puzzles as you face the unknown in this thrilling horror game.",
